{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"103716","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/103716","key":"MC-214622","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"09/Feb/21 4:27 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p>I'd strongly recommend also adding a sound (or empty sound event at the very least) for this, since many related actions (e.g. changing a comparator's mode) have sounds.</p>\n\n<p>This action would without a doubt be considered a \"block change\", and as such should create a vibration of some sort.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Howtoreproduce\"></a>How to reproduce</h3>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Place down a daylight detector and a sculk sensor nearby</li>\n\t<li>Change the mode of the daylight detector by right-clicking on it</li>\n\t<li>Take note as to whether or not a vibration is created and/or if the sculk sensor is activated upon switching the daylight detector's mode</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"ExpectedBehavior\"></a>Expected Behavior</h3>\n<p>A vibration would be produced upon switching daylight detector modes, which the sculk sensor would detect.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"ObservedBehavior\"></a>Observed Behavior</h3>\n<p>No such vibration is produced, and the sculk sensor is not activated at all.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Codeanalysis\"></a>Code analysis</h3>\n<p>Code analysis by <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=Avoma\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Avoma</a> can be found in <a href=\"https://bugs.mojang.com/browse/MC-214622?focusedCommentId=1161874&amp;page=com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.issuetabpanels:comment-tabpanel#comment-1161874\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">this comment</a>.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"09/Feb/21 4:40 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/135426","id":"135426","filename":"2021-02-09_12.26.16.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png"},"displayName":"muzikbike","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Dublin","accountType":"customer"},"created":"09/Feb/21 4:27 AM","size":"241 kB","mimeType":"image/png","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/135426","thumbnail":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/135426"},{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/135427","id":"135427","filename":"2021-02-09_12.26.17.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png"},"displayName":"muzikbike","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Dublin","accountType":"customer"},"created":"09/Feb/21 4:27 AM","size":"242 kB","mimeType":"image/png","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/135427","thumbnail":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/135427"},{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/135428","id":"135428","filename":"MC-214622.mp4","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://